{"request_id":"sha256:0696e8d8635c9e72edcba5fe6d531f8b2637f85ce9f791a776389dc7df2605d1","units":[{"unit_id":"sha256:5af948eb6210b0f7e047a83e111aaa2d045df14975f384e4393a2b97fa6a207d","reviewed":true,"findings":[{"kind":"SALES_OR_SHIPMENTS","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":202}],"reason":"As of December 31, 2025, Enphase had shipped approximately 86.4 million microinverters cumulatively; this is a cumulative shipment count, not an actual production quantity for a period."},{"kind":"CAPACITY_QUALITATIVE","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":282}],"reason":"Enphase states that in November 2025 it commenced manufacturing at its Arlington, Texas facility and that it is currently shipping residential and commercial IQ Microinverters and IQ Batteries with higher domestic content from U.S.-based manufacturing facilities in South Carolina and Texas, where it added several new production lines; this is a qualitative statement about manufacturing operations and capacity expansion, not a quantified available capacity figure."},{"kind":"CAPACITY_QUALITATIVE","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":281}],"reason":"Enphase describes its manufacturing model, including outsourcing assembly and testing of certain IQ microinverters, IQ Battery storage systems, EV chargers and IQ Gateway products to third-party contract manufacturers (Flex, Salcomp, Sunwoda); this is a qualitative description of manufacturing arrangements, not a quantified production or capacity figure."},{"kind":"OTHER_CONTEXT","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":146}],"reason":"Forward-looking statement that Enphase has expectations about the number of microinverter units that can be produced per quarter; this is a forward-looking expectation about future production capability, not an actual production quantity or a currently available capacity figure."},{"kind":"OTHER_CONTEXT","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":306}],"reason":"Enphase states it has relocated a significant portion of its manufacturing to the United States while continuing to utilize contract manufacturing in China and India, with certain critical components sourced outside the United States; this is a qualitative supply-chain and manufacturing location statement, not a quantified production or capacity figure."},{"kind":"OTHER_CONTEXT","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":307}],"reason":"Enphase states that LFP battery cells used in its energy storage systems are supplied exclusively by two vendors located in China and that it is exploring alternative suppliers; this is a supply-chain statement about component sourcing, not a production or capacity quantity."},{"kind":"OTHER_CONTEXT","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":330}],"reason":"Enphase reports 2,872 full-time employees as of December 31, 2025, including 148 in manufacturing; this is a headcount disclosure, not a production or capacity quantity."}],"unresolved":[],"calculation_limits":["TARGET_CURRENT_PRODUCTION_NOT_PRESENT_IN_THIS_UNIT","TARGET_CURRENT_CAPACITY_NOT_PRESENT_IN_THIS_UNIT","QUANTITIES_NOT_COMPARABLE"]}]}